#: manual/index.md:1
msgid "QED"
msgstr "QED"

#: manual/index.md:3
msgid "QED (Quite Easy Deduction) is a theorem prover written in MoonBit with a kernel-first architecture. The MoonBit implementation provides an executable, tested trusted kernel and a controlled frontend. A Lean 4 formalization in `formal_verification/` aligns the implementation with the paper specification for semantics, audit and conformance."
msgstr "QED（Quite Easy Deduction）是一个基于 MoonBit、采用 kernel-first 架构的定理证明器。MoonBit 实现提供可执行、可测试的可信内核与受控前端。`formal_verification/` 中的 Lean 4 形式化负责让实现与论文规范在语义、审计与符合性上保持对齐。"

#: manual/index.md:5
msgid "Formal specification"
msgstr "形式规范"

#: manual/index.md:7
msgid "The formal specification is the only normative source for the kernel."
msgstr "形式规范是内核唯一的规范性来源。"

#: manual/index.md:11
msgid "Packages"
msgstr "包"

#: manual/index.md:13
msgid "**`kernel`** (`src/kernel`): the trusted kernel. See the [API reference](api/kernel.md), the [design notes](design/kernel.md) and the [tutorial](tutorial/kernel.md)."
msgstr "**`kernel`**（`src/kernel`）：可信内核。参见 [API 参考](api/kernel.md)、[设计说明](design/kernel.md)和[教程](tutorial/kernel.md)。"

#: manual/index.md:14
msgid "**`parser`** (`src/parser`): the text frontend and its bridge to the kernel. See the [API reference](api/parser.md), the [design notes](design/parser.md) and the [tutorial](tutorial/parser.md)."
msgstr "**`parser`**（`src/parser`）：文本前端及其通往内核的桥接层。参见 [API 参考](api/parser.md)、[设计说明](design/parser.md)和[教程](tutorial/parser.md)。"

#: manual/index.md:15
msgid "**`tactics`** (`src/tactics`): the proof-state execution engine. See the [API reference](api/tactics.md), the [design notes](design/tactics.md) and the [tutorial](tutorial/tactics.md)."
msgstr "**`tactics`**（`src/tactics`）：证明状态执行引擎。参见 [API 参考](api/tactics.md)、[设计说明](design/tactics.md)和[教程](tutorial/tactics.md)。"

#: manual/index.md:16
msgid "**`prover`** (`src/prover`): the theorem-script driver. See the [API reference](api/prover.md), the [design notes](design/prover.md) and the [tutorial](tutorial/prover.md)."
msgstr "**`prover`**（`src/prover`）：theorem-script 驱动器。参见 [API 参考](api/prover.md)、[设计说明](design/prover.md)和[教程](tutorial/prover.md)。"

