msgid "Theorem-header binders `(x : bool)` and raw `forall` / `∀` theorem goals are both part of the currently shipped quantifier-facing user syntax."
msgstr "theorem-header binder `(x : bool)` 与 raw `forall` / `∀` theorem goal 都属于当前已 shipped 的量词面用户语法。"

#: manual/syntax.md:133
msgid "Raw `forall (x : A), body` / `∀ (x : A), body` is accepted only at the theorem-script goal / `parse_goal` entry points; it is not term-level syntax."
msgstr "raw `forall (x : A), body` / `∀ (x : A), body` 只在 theorem-script goal / `parse_goal` 入口上被接受，不是 term-level 语法。"

#: manual/syntax.md:135
msgid "The raw `forall` path is currently only goal sugar; it follows the same lowering / replay / CLI diagnostics contract and introduces no new kernel quantifier authority."
msgstr "raw `forall` 这条路径当前只是 goal sugar；它沿用同一条 lowering / replay / CLI diagnostics 合同，不引入新的 kernel quantifier authority。"

