msgid "The current shipped steps are only these:"
msgstr "当前 shipped 的 step 只有这几类："

#: manual/syntax.md:177
msgid "When the current goal is `A -> B`, introduces a local hypothesis and continues by proving the consequent."
msgstr "当当前目标是 `A -> B` 时，引入一个局部假设并继续证明后件。"

#: manual/syntax.md:187
msgid "Closes the current goal directly."
msgstr "用于直接闭合当前目标。"

#: manual/syntax.md:195
msgid "Applies an implication-backed theorem or a local implication hypothesis to the current goal, producing new subgoals."
msgstr "用于把 implication-backed theorem 或局部蕴含假设作用到当前目标上，产生新的子目标。"

#: manual/syntax.md:204
msgid "Searches the current local hypotheses for evidence that matches the current goal."
msgstr "在当前局部假设中寻找与当前目标匹配的证据。"

#: manual/syntax.md:208
#: manual/syntax.md:222
