msgstr "顺序写法："

#: manual/syntax.md:214
#: manual/syntax.md:229
msgid "Structured branch form:"
msgstr "结构化分支写法："

#: manual/syntax.md:243
msgid "`hole` does not fake success; it currently returns a structured unfinished result."
msgstr "`hole` 不会伪造成功；当前会返回结构化 unfinished 结果。"

#: manual/syntax.md:245
msgid "Sequential blocks and structured branch blocks"
msgstr "顺序块与结构化分支块"

#: manual/syntax.md:247
msgid "`<steps>` can currently be written on a single line:"
msgstr "当前 `<steps>` 可以写成单行："

#: manual/syntax.md:253
msgid "or as a multi-line block:"
msgstr "也可以写成多行块："

#: manual/syntax.md:262
msgid "When steps need explicit branching, a minimal structured branch block is currently supported:"
msgstr "当步骤需要显式分支时，当前支持最小结构化 branch block："

#: manual/syntax.md:271
msgid "An example closer to classical propositional logic:"
msgstr "更像经典命题逻辑的例子："

#: manual/syntax.md:287
msgid "Most important current limitations"
msgstr "当前最重要的限制"

#: manual/syntax.md:289
msgid "The current `src/cmd` workflow is file-first; a single-theorem file may omit the trailing `qed`, and a multi-theorem file uses `qed` as a separator."
msgstr "当前 `src/cmd` 工作流是 file-first；单 theorem 文件可省略末尾 `qed`，多 theorem 文件用 `qed` 分隔。"

#: manual/syntax.md:291
msgid "Directly runnable public examples should preferably use the existing scripts in `examples/`."
msgstr "直接 runnable 的公开例子应优先使用 `examples/` 中已有脚本。"

#: manual/syntax.md:292
msgid "Theorem-header binders are shipped; raw `forall` theorem goals are supported as goal-only sugar, while term-level forms are still unsupported."
msgstr "theorem-header binder 已 shipped；raw `forall` theorem goal 作为 goal-only sugar 已支持，term-level 仍不支持。"

#: manual/syntax.md:294
msgid "Unsupported paths must fail closed and never fake theorem success."
msgstr "不支持的路径必须 fail-closed，不会伪造 theorem success。"

#: manual/syntax.md:295
msgid "`hole` returns unfinished, not theorem success."
msgstr "`hole` 返回 unfinished，不返回 theorem success。"

#: manual/syntax.md:297
msgid "Output shape"
msgstr "输出形状"

#: manual/syntax.md:299
msgid "Current CLI output falls into three categories:"
msgstr "当前 CLI 输出分三类："

#: manual/syntax.md:301
msgid "Success: by default, one line `ok <theorem_name>` per theorem; with `-d`, the output is `ok <theorem_name>: <conclusion_summary>`"
msgstr "成功：默认每个 theorem 输出一行 `ok <theorem_name>`；使用 `-d` 时输出 `ok <theorem_name>: <conclusion_summary>`"

#: manual/syntax.md:303
msgid "Failure: `error[kind] ...`"
msgstr "失败：`error[kind] ...`"

#: manual/syntax.md:304
msgid "Unfinished: `warning[unfinished] ...`; it produces no theorem authority, but checking continues with the following theorems."
msgstr "未完成：`warning[unfinished] ...`，不会产生 theorem authority，但会继续检查后续 theorem。"

#: manual/syntax.md:307
msgid "The `--` in `moon run src/cmd -- -d --no-warn <file>` belongs only to `moon run` argument forwarding; a standalone executable does not need it, so run `qed-cmd -d --no-warn <file>` directly."
msgstr "`moon run src/cmd -- -d --no-warn <file>` 中的 `--` 只属于 `moon run` 参数转发；独立可执行文件不需要它，直接用 `qed-cmd -d --no-warn <file>`。"

#: manual/syntax.md:310
msgid "See [User manual](manual.md) for the complete failure fields, unfinished fields, and stable examples."
msgstr "更完整的失败字段、unfinished 字段和稳定示例见 [用户手册](manual.md)。"

